WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.880
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.150 --> 00:29.470
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.550 --> 00:32.780
[Episode 17]

4
00:40.240 --> 00:42.240
I thought you'd never play it again.

5
00:45.200 --> 00:46.110
Ning Changyue.

6
00:47.520 --> 00:49.650
Sometimes your thinking you know best

7
00:50.070 --> 00:51.710
is really annoying.

8
00:54.710 --> 00:56.710
So this time, did you also think

9
00:57.290 --> 00:59.100
that leaving was what I wanted?

10
00:59.560 --> 01:01.560
Just like every other time before?

11
01:18.500 --> 01:20.030
I find it unbelievable too.

12
01:20.680 --> 01:22.680
That it took me this long to figure out

13
01:22.680 --> 01:24.510
the way your stupid mind works.

14
01:25.070 --> 01:25.760
All of this,

15
01:26.840 --> 01:28.310
and the things in the car,

16
01:29.150 --> 01:31.740
were the dowry you gave me that year when you sent me off to marry

17
01:31.740 --> 01:33.470
in the name of being my brother.

18
01:34.410 --> 01:36.610
Back then, did you want to make me happy?

19
01:36.710 --> 01:37.729
But let me tell you this.

20
01:37.729 --> 01:38.620
That night,

21
01:39.430 --> 01:41.890
I was going to return the marriage contract.

22
02:01.730 --> 02:02.610
But Ning Changyue,

23
02:02.610 --> 02:03.970
I want you to know this.

24
02:04.000 --> 02:05.230
I don't care for it.

25
02:05.230 --> 02:06.710
I don't want it either.

26
02:07.680 --> 02:08.910
From then until now,

27
02:10.190 --> 02:11.820
you've always made decisions

28
02:11.820 --> 02:13.540
for both of us all by yourself.

29
02:14.120 --> 02:15.240
You never once asked me

30
02:15.240 --> 02:16.470
what I wanted.

31
02:18.150 --> 02:18.960
I'm sorry.

32
02:21.910 --> 02:22.470
Qiu,

33
02:23.750 --> 02:24.800
my biggest regret is

34
02:24.800 --> 02:26.660
that I didn't believe in our love.

35
02:27.150 --> 02:29.480
We wasted 72 years and 37 days for nothing.

36
02:30.520 --> 02:32.920
Ending our immortality was just an excuse,

37
02:33.840 --> 02:35.710
an excuse to stay by your side.

38
02:37.790 --> 02:39.160
What I truly wanted

39
02:41.290 --> 02:42.890
was to be by your side.

40
02:44.840 --> 02:45.750
It is now,

41
02:47.120 --> 02:48.380
and it always has been.

42
02:51.680 --> 02:52.470
Song Yiqiu,

43
02:53.230 --> 02:54.480
let's

44
02:56.050 --> 02:57.110
get back together.

45
03:23.000 --> 03:25.860
♪ Haunted like a shadow ♪

46
03:28.650 --> 03:33.570
♪ It's invisible but heavy like a stone ♪

47
03:34.060 --> 03:36.340
♪ Trying to rival ♪

48
03:39.490 --> 03:45.100
♪ Tangled in a web but still won't let me go ♪

49
03:48.079 --> 03:50.540
But this time, I selfishly chose to leave you

50
03:52.630 --> 03:55.190
because I couldn't face your death

51
03:57.910 --> 03:58.800
for real.

52
04:00.150 --> 04:01.010
What happened?

53
04:01.190 --> 04:02.790
Why hasn't the wound healed?

54
04:03.030 --> 04:04.800
The patient's condition is critical.

55
04:04.800 --> 04:07.310
If the knife had been a fraction off, she couldn't have been saved.

56
04:07.310 --> 04:09.030
She's still not out of danger.

57
04:21.600 --> 04:22.560
Ning Changyue,

58
04:23.950 --> 04:25.410
whether it's immortality

59
04:26.190 --> 04:27.720
or a finite life,

60
04:30.190 --> 04:31.040
from beginning to end,

61
04:31.040 --> 04:32.640
all I have ever wanted is you.

62
04:34.520 --> 04:36.210
♪ I'll tear this heart right from my chest ♪

63
04:36.210 --> 04:37.530
What I want

64
04:38.510 --> 04:40.120
is to have you by my side.

65
04:40.250 --> 04:44.830
♪ Shattered into pieces ♪

66
04:45.720 --> 04:46.220
♪ Until my lungs have nothing left ♪

67
04:46.220 --> 04:47.470
You idiot.

68
04:52.620 --> 04:55.120
♪ I'll kill the beauty that kept me awake, oh ♪

69
04:55.120 --> 04:56.360
Let's go home.

70
04:57.240 --> 04:58.040
Okay.

71
05:04.430 --> 05:05.240
Today...

72
05:07.810 --> 05:09.930
Why is this painting in the fridge?

73
05:11.430 --> 05:13.240
Shouldn't it be hung up?

74
05:15.040 --> 05:15.830
Wu Ya!

75
05:17.000 --> 05:17.800
I'm bleeding.

76
05:18.010 --> 05:18.960
Let me take a look.

77
05:18.960 --> 05:19.520
This...

78
05:20.950 --> 05:21.900
This is a wound.

79
05:22.540 --> 05:23.950
It's gone.

80
05:25.750 --> 05:26.550
It left a scar.

81
05:28.200 --> 05:29.690
A scar? That's serious.

82
05:29.720 --> 05:30.530
If you'd waited any longer to go to the hospital,

83
05:30.530 --> 05:32.040
you could've lost the limb.

84
05:32.040 --> 05:33.190
No. It left a...

85
05:33.190 --> 05:35.630
Wu Ya! Wu Ya!

86
05:35.630 --> 05:36.510
Wu Ya!

87
05:36.510 --> 05:38.560
My skin is rotting.

88
05:42.120 --> 05:42.880
Qiu.

89
05:43.070 --> 05:46.260
Did you know there's something called acne?

90
05:46.590 --> 05:47.990
Acne?

91
05:49.030 --> 05:50.340
Does that mean...

92
05:50.360 --> 05:51.320
That means we've

93
05:52.040 --> 05:53.440
become ordinary people!

94
05:54.240 --> 05:55.070
Qiu!

95
05:57.409 --> 05:58.430
Wait for me. Wait a second.

96
05:58.430 --> 06:00.510
Well. Why?

97
06:01.000 --> 06:01.430
You...

98
06:01.430 --> 06:02.000
Qiu.

99
06:02.240 --> 06:03.510
Give me another cut.

100
06:03.510 --> 06:03.800
Come on, come on.

101
06:03.800 --> 06:04.430
Wait!

102
06:04.430 --> 06:05.390
Come on, try it.

103
06:05.390 --> 06:06.120
Just try it.

104
06:06.120 --> 06:06.560
Give it a shot.

105
06:06.560 --> 06:07.270
What are you doing?

106
06:07.270 --> 06:07.750
No way.

107
06:07.750 --> 06:08.510
Come on, come on.

108
06:08.510 --> 06:09.360
Just try it.

109
06:09.360 --> 06:10.240
-No. -It's really fine.

110
06:10.240 --> 06:10.920
No!

111
06:10.920 --> 06:12.450
-Give me a scar! -Calm down.

112
06:14.510 --> 06:15.270
I'm a man.

113
06:16.660 --> 06:18.660
You must be in so much pain.

114
06:18.800 --> 06:19.600
I'm fine.

115
06:19.920 --> 06:20.480
I can...

116
06:20.480 --> 06:21.240
Qiu.

117
06:22.310 --> 06:23.110
It hurts.

118
06:23.430 --> 06:23.920
Go away.

119
06:24.430 --> 06:24.940
Okay.

120
06:29.010 --> 06:30.010
Let me blow on it.

121
06:31.920 --> 06:32.750
Don't worry.

122
06:33.080 --> 06:34.230
I can tough it out.

123
06:34.920 --> 06:36.920
Baby, I got you some face masks.

124
06:36.950 --> 06:38.270
They have 12 benefits.

125
06:38.720 --> 06:42.040
Whitening, nourishing, firming, anti-aging...

126
06:42.060 --> 06:43.450
I also got you some supplements.

127
06:43.450 --> 06:45.230
For your heart, kidneys, and liver.

128
06:45.230 --> 06:45.680
And...

129
06:45.680 --> 06:48.040
You're so good to me, Honey.

130
06:54.520 --> 06:55.520
Qiu.

131
06:56.000 --> 06:57.560
We can finally be together.

132
06:58.310 --> 07:01.000
I'll cherish every wrinkle on your face.

133
07:14.010 --> 07:15.010
What?

134
07:30.760 --> 07:32.400
♪ Bittersweet ♪

135
07:33.930 --> 07:39.659
♪ But your love tortures me ♪

136
07:43.790 --> 07:45.400
♪ Destiny ♪

137
07:47.200 --> 07:49.630
♪ But you want to leave ♪

138
07:49.630 --> 07:51.000
What if I told you

139
07:51.640 --> 07:53.080
my room has a leak?

140
07:54.070 --> 07:55.270
Would you believe me?

141
07:56.909 --> 08:00.040
♪ My darling, we could have been so perfect together ♪

142
08:00.040 --> 08:01.700
Do you think I'd believe that?

143
08:02.720 --> 08:03.480
It's true.

144
08:03.480 --> 08:03.550
It's really bad.

145
08:03.550 --> 08:04.510
♪ Are we trapped in a dream forever? ♪

146
08:04.510 --> 08:05.800
There's water all over the bed and floor.

147
08:05.800 --> 08:07.860
No one could possibly sleep in there.

148
08:08.750 --> 08:10.600
Then sleep in the living room.

149
08:10.620 --> 08:18.060
♪ Your bittersweet back and forth is killing me ♪

150
08:18.610 --> 08:24.310
♪ Why you gotta be ♪

151
08:24.820 --> 08:27.810
♪ Bittersweet ♪

152
08:28.310 --> 08:29.240
What a huge bug!

153
08:29.240 --> 08:30.390
I'll kill it for you.

154
08:31.580 --> 08:33.260
♪ Bittersweet ♪

155
08:39.510 --> 08:41.010
♪ Bittersweet ♪

156
08:42.940 --> 08:44.200
♪ This was just a dream ♪

157
08:44.200 --> 08:45.550
So annoying.

158
08:48.390 --> 08:49.750
Ning Changyue.

159
08:51.230 --> 08:52.650
That's such a lame excuse.

160
08:52.650 --> 08:54.330
I can't believe you came up with it.

161
08:54.330 --> 08:55.210
I'm so sleepy.

162
08:55.840 --> 08:57.370
Why am I so sleepy?

163
08:57.920 --> 08:59.590
I can barely keep my eyes open.

164
09:02.150 --> 09:03.350
Get off.

165
09:09.600 --> 09:10.960
Three.

166
09:13.750 --> 09:15.240
Two.

167
09:16.910 --> 09:17.830
One.

168
09:24.710 --> 09:26.120
How did I fall asleep?

169
09:26.630 --> 09:28.320
When did I fall asleep?

170
09:28.320 --> 09:29.750
I'm so sleepy.

171
09:38.140 --> 09:41.020
Remember to have someone fix the pipes tomorrow.

172
09:41.120 --> 09:41.870
Okay.

173
10:01.050 --> 10:02.500
Go to sleep.

174
10:22.810 --> 10:26.390
♪ The words left unspoken for too long ♪

175
10:26.810 --> 10:30.680
♪ Your name rests deep in my heart ♪

176
10:30.700 --> 10:35.240
♪ Every time I look back, that familiar figure ♪

177
10:35.500 --> 10:38.780
♪ Is still by my side ♪

178
10:54.240 --> 10:57.180
♪ Longing lingers through the seasons ♪

179
10:57.980 --> 11:01.180
♪ As fate turns back around ♪

180
11:02.080 --> 11:04.840
♪ If I could grow old with you ♪

181
11:04.870 --> 11:08.920
♪ That would be enough for one lifetime ♪

182
11:22.020 --> 11:22.850
Morning, Qiu.

183
11:23.570 --> 11:24.260
Morning.

184
11:29.900 --> 11:32.500
You two slept together last night?

185
11:39.360 --> 11:41.870
Change the sheets. Fix the pipes.

186
11:44.400 --> 11:45.520
Lin Huai has been discharged.

187
11:45.520 --> 11:46.920
He asked to see me tonight.

188
11:46.920 --> 11:48.070
What do you think?

189
12:02.010 --> 12:03.610
You're fully recovered now?

190
12:08.440 --> 12:11.900
I feel like I've been lying in the hospital for a very long time.

191
12:12.590 --> 12:15.520
Like I've been dreaming for what feels like forever.

192
12:16.000 --> 12:17.550
I think it's time to wake up.

193
12:19.550 --> 12:20.360
Song Yiqiu.

194
12:22.630 --> 12:23.910
Autumn Art Gallery

195
12:25.080 --> 12:26.200
is closing.

196
12:27.870 --> 12:28.790
Why?

197
12:30.600 --> 12:32.600
I've always loved those paintings.

198
12:32.720 --> 12:34.450
I thought they were beautiful,

199
12:34.600 --> 12:37.150
and I was obsessed with collecting them.

200
12:38.550 --> 12:40.120
But eventually, I realized

201
12:40.970 --> 12:43.100
that when I looked at those paintings,

202
12:43.150 --> 12:45.550
I wasn't seeing the paintings themselves.

203
12:45.550 --> 12:47.150
I was seeing you,

204
12:49.280 --> 12:51.140
trapped behind those paintings.

205
12:58.000 --> 12:59.070
What about now?

206
13:00.480 --> 13:01.720
Now I understand.

207
13:05.680 --> 13:06.840
Your eyes

208
13:08.120 --> 13:09.790
have never been looking at me.

209
13:16.000 --> 13:17.630
So I shouldn't

210
13:18.670 --> 13:19.960
force my own feelings

211
13:19.960 --> 13:21.440
onto you either.

212
13:25.580 --> 13:26.580
I'm sorry.

213
13:27.570 --> 13:29.500
For General Yu 3,000 years ago,

214
13:30.850 --> 13:32.110
and for all the trouble

215
13:34.000 --> 13:35.910
I've caused you over the years.

216
13:40.390 --> 13:41.270
Don't worry.

217
13:42.340 --> 13:44.540
Whatever you wish for is what I wish for.

218
13:46.200 --> 13:47.360
From now on,

219
13:48.180 --> 13:50.310
I'll just be Lin Huai in this lifetime.

220
13:53.550 --> 13:54.720
And I hope you

221
13:56.390 --> 13:57.600
will always be free.

222
14:03.600 --> 14:05.200
I'll take that as a blessing.

223
14:26.510 --> 14:27.320
Who is he?

224
14:28.400 --> 14:29.070
Him?

225
14:29.370 --> 14:30.500
-He's... -I'm Wu Ya.

226
14:30.840 --> 14:32.360
Yu Tu's best friend.

227
14:34.680 --> 14:35.600
And this is...

228
14:35.620 --> 14:36.620
Tell me about her.

229
14:37.000 --> 14:38.200
She's mine.

230
14:39.390 --> 14:41.120
Says who?

231
14:41.120 --> 14:43.000
She's yours? Take your hands off her.

232
14:43.000 --> 14:44.320
-She's my sister. -How long have we known each other?

233
14:44.320 --> 14:45.320
Where were you when we first met?

234
14:45.320 --> 14:45.600
She's my real sister.

235
14:45.600 --> 14:46.750
We're blood siblings.

236
14:46.750 --> 14:47.890
-Move. -Of course she's mine.

237
14:47.890 --> 14:48.470
You move.

238
14:49.030 --> 14:49.600
Stop.

239
14:55.300 --> 14:58.910
The three of us are the best of friends.

240
15:08.490 --> 15:10.310
My sister and I are putting on nourishing masks.

241
15:10.310 --> 15:11.590
Why are you joining us?

242
15:12.090 --> 15:14.510
I've been running around with my uncle lately.

243
15:14.510 --> 15:15.690
I've gotten so tanned.

244
15:15.690 --> 15:17.420
Can't I whiten my skin a little?

245
15:19.880 --> 15:21.030
What's that smell coming from your face masks?

246
15:21.030 --> 15:22.760
Why does it smell kind of funky?

247
15:22.870 --> 15:24.110
-Get lost. -Get lost.

248
15:25.040 --> 15:26.400
Go back to your place!

249
15:28.430 --> 15:28.920
I can't.

250
15:29.520 --> 15:32.400
That place is terrifying now.

251
15:36.000 --> 15:36.790
Qiu.

252
15:37.320 --> 15:39.790
We can finally be together forever.

253
15:40.180 --> 15:43.820
I'll cherish every wrinkle on your face.

254
15:46.150 --> 15:48.320
Hello, everyone who's joined the livestream!

255
15:48.320 --> 15:50.200
Behind me is the home of the two who've been making headlines lately,

256
15:50.200 --> 15:52.790
the legendary immortals.

257
15:52.960 --> 15:54.270
Yes, these are the two.

258
15:54.270 --> 15:55.910
They've lived for 3,000 years!

259
15:55.910 --> 15:57.080
Tell me, isn't that terrifying?

260
15:57.080 --> 15:59.030
Today, we're going to uncover the truth together.

261
15:59.030 --> 15:59.630
Oh, my God!

262
15:59.630 --> 16:01.000
The Ultimate Immortality Reveal!

263
16:01.000 --> 16:02.000
Secrets about immortality have leaked.

264
16:02.000 --> 16:04.120
The 3,000-year-old immortals have finally been exposed.

265
16:04.120 --> 16:05.120
The medical world is shaken.

266
16:05.120 --> 16:06.150
Uncovering the secrets of immortality...

267
16:06.150 --> 16:07.270
The trending searches are blowing up.

268
16:07.270 --> 16:09.320
So there really are people

269
16:09.320 --> 16:10.600
who have lived for 3,000 years.
